  (Mutual Confidentiality, Non-Solicitation &amp; Non-Circumvention Agreement)<br><br>
  This Agreement is entered into between <strong>Italy Nihao Group Limited</strong>
  and <strong>{{ client_entity_name or "________________________________" }}</strong>{% if client_entity_type %} ({{ client_entity_type }}){% endif %}{% if client_jurisdiction %}, incorporated in {{ client_jurisdiction }}{% endif %}.
</p>

